collapsible\" data-collapse-key=\"account\"><button class=\"nav-label nav-label-toggle\" type=\"button\" data-tooltip=\"管理个人资料、主题与账号安全；运营后台仅对有权限的账号显示。\" aria-description=\"管理个人资料、主题与账号安全；运营后台仅对有权限的账号显示。\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"账户与设置，点击收起菜单\"><span>账户与设置</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg></button><a class=\"nav-item \" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html\" data-nav-key=\"settings\" data-tooltip=\"管理会员资料、主题样式、登录安全与邀约记录。\" aria-description=\"管理会员资料、主题样式、登录安全与邀约记录。\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#settings\"></use></svg><span>个人设置</span></a></section><div class=\"nav-scroll-fade-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></nav>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-bottom\"><div class=\"mini-membership\" data-settings-link-ready=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\" title=\"点击打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\"><div class=\"mini-avatar\" data-member-initial=\"\">何</div><div><span data-member-name=\"\">演示用户</span><small data-member-level=\"\">天使</small></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sidebar-resize-handle\" role=\"separator\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" title=\"拖动调整菜单宽度\"></div></aside>\n  <main class=\"workspace-main\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"topbar-left\"><button class=\"mobile-menu\" type=\"button\" data-open-sidebar=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg#menu\"></use></svg></button><div><span>SMART PLANS</span><div class=\"page-heading-row\"><h1>素材整理计划</h1><p class=\"page-intro\" data-page-note=\"\">确认自己的材料，持续准备好内容。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"topbar-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"global-search-trigger\" data-open-search=\"\" aria-label=\"打开全站搜索\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#search\"></use></svg><span>搜索</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button><a class=\"back-dashboard\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/main.html\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#home\"></use></svg><span>返回我的工作台</span></a></div></header>\n    <div class=\"settings-content sm-shell dp-shell\">\n      <section class=\"pm-hero\"><div><h2>把经历记下来，让内容持续准备好</h2><p>定期整理你授权的笔记，提炼真实经历、个人观点和实用方法。确认后，可继续用于短视频脚本和朋友圈文案。</p><ol class=\"sm-steps\"><li><b>01</b>导入笔记或整理文档</li><li><b>02</b>整理经历、观点和方法</li><li><b>03</b>核对并确认用途</li><li><b>04</b>继续创作内容</li></ol></div></section>\n      <p class=\"pm-status\" data-smart-status=\"\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">计划和材料已读取。</p>\n      <div data-smart-app=\"\">\n        <nav class=\"smart-section-nav\" aria-label=\"素材整理步骤\"><a href=\"#smart-prompt\">01 生成我的专属提示词</a><a href=\"#smart-discover\">02 发现新素材</a><a href=\"#materials\">03 确认可用的笔记</a><a href=\"#smart-gifts\" data-gifts-nav=\"\">04 可提供的赠品</a><a href=\"#smart-video\">05 准备短视频</a><a href=\"#moments\">06 准备朋友圈</a></nav>\n        <section class=\"settings-card pm-panel\" id=\"smart-prompt\" data-story-prompt=\"\"><header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2><span class=\"smart-section-number\">01</span>生成我的专属提示词</h2><p class=\"pm-muted\">复制到得到大脑，让它从你的笔记里整理值得分享的经历。</p></div></header><details data-story-prompt-fold=\"\" open=\"\"><summary>展开或收起提示词</summary><div class=\"story-prompt-options\"><label class=\"pm-field\">这次使用的商业定位<select data-story-prompt-portrait=\"\"><option value=\"\">暂不使用商业定位</option></select></label><label class=\"pm-field\">搜索近期几天的笔记<span class=\"story-days-input\"><input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"14\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" inputmode=\"numeric\" data-story-prompt-days=\"\" required=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">天</span></span></label></div><div class=\"dp-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" data-story-prompt-generate=\"\">生成提示词</button></div><div data-story-prompt-result=\"\" hidden=\"\"><label class=\"pm-field member-action-field\">复制前可检查和修改<span class=\"story-prompt-editor\" data-story-prompt-editor=\"\"><textarea data-story-prompt-output=\"\" rows=\"12\" maxlength=\"50000\"></textarea><span class=\"story-prompt-count\" data-story-prompt-count=\"\" aria-live=\"off\">0字符</span></span></label><div class=\"dp-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-story-prompt-save=\"\">保存修改</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" data-story-prompt-copy=\"\">复制提示词</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-story-prompt-max=\"\">编辑区最大化</button></div><p class=\"pm-muted\">到得到大脑执行后，请按提示词里的名称保存，名称含北京时间。系统也会识别旧名称。</p></div><p class=\"pm-status\" data-story-prompt-status=\"\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></details><dialog class=\"pm-dialog story-prompt-modal\" data-story-prompt-modal=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"story-prompt-modal-title\"><header class=\"pm-heading\"><h2 id=\"story-prompt-modal-title\">编辑提示词</h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-story-prompt-close=\"\">退出最大化</button></header><div class=\"story-prompt-modal-content\" data-story-prompt-modal-content=\"\"></div></dialog></section>\n        <section class=\"settings-card pm-panel\" id=\"smart-discover\"><header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2><span class=\"smart-section-number\">02</span>发现新素材</h2><p data-smart-summary=\"\">尚未开启 · 待确认 0 篇</p><p class=\"pm-muted\" data-smart-mining-status=\"\">只同步得到大脑的素材集合；检查和保存不调用大模型。</p></div></header>\n          <form data-smart-form=\"\"><p class=\"pm-muted\" data-smart-source-connection=\"\">得到大脑尚未连接，请先连接。</p><p class=\"pm-muted\">每次在最近100条笔记中查找素材集合，保存到“我的笔记”，供你核对并选择用途。检查过程不调用大模型。</p>\n          <label class=\"pm-field\">检查频次<select data-smart-interval=\"\"><option value=\"1\">每 1 小时</option><option value=\"2\">每 2 小时</option><option value=\"4\">每 4 小时</option><option value=\"8\">每 8 小时</option><option value=\"12\">每 12 小时</option><option value=\"24\" selected=\"\">每 24 小时</option><option value=\"36\">每 36 小时</option><option value=\"48\">每 48 小时</option><option value=\"72\">每 72 小时</option></select></label><p class=\"pm-muted\">首次检查最近72小时新增或更新的素材集合，之后检查新版本；来源没有可靠时间时按首次发现时间处理。发现新素材后会及时提醒。</p>\n          <label class=\"dp-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-smart-consent=\"\" required=\"\">我同意系统读取得到大脑中的素材集合，并私密保存到我的笔记</label>\n          <div class=\"dp-actions\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\">开启并保存计划</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-smart-check=\"\" disabled=\"\">现在检查</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-smart-pause=\"\" disabled=\"\">暂停检查</button><a class=\"pm-btn\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html#settings-biji\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">连接或修改来源</a></div><p class=\"pm-status\" data-smart-form-status=\"\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">计划和材料已读取。</p></form>\n          <details><summary>已有素材整理文档？整理成一篇笔记</summary><p class=\"pm-muted\">可上传或粘贴从历史笔记整理出的故事稿。先逐条查看事件摘要、来源和待核实提醒，再保存为一篇私密笔记。这里不调用模型；导出的摘要不是原始笔记，事实、归属、数据和隐私仍需你核对。</p>\n            <label class=\"pm-field\">选择文档<input type=\"file\" accept=\".md,.txt,text/plain,text/markdown\" data-story-file=\"\"></label><label class=\"pm-field\">笔记标题<input type=\"text\" maxlength=\"120\" value=\"稳行高处｜我的创作素材集合\" data-story-title=\"\"></label><label class=\"pm-field member-action-field\">或粘贴整理文档<textarea rows=\"5\" maxlength=\"200000\" data-story-document=\"\"></textarea></label>\n            <div class=\"dp-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-story-preview=\"\">查看故事和选题</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" data-story-save=\"\" disabled=\"\">保存这一篇笔记</button></div><p class=\"pm-status\" data-story-status=\"\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><div data-story-cards=\"\"></div><details data-story-preview-box=\"\" hidden=\"\"><summary>查看将保存的笔记正文</summary><pre data-story-content=\"\"></pre></details><div data-story-link=\"\"></div>\n          </details>\n          <details class=\"smart-checks\"><summary>最近的检查</summary><p class=\"pm-muted\">检查得到大脑时不调用大模型。</p><div data-smart-runs=\"\"><p class=\"pm-muted\">还没有执行记录。</p></div><nav class=\"sm-pagination\" data-smart-run-pages=\"\" aria-label=\"执行记录翻页\"></nav></details>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"settings-card pm-panel\" id=\"materials\"><header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2><span class=\"smart-section-number\">03</span>确认可用的笔记</h2><p>按你选择的用途，供自己的短视频或朋友圈参考；不会对其他会员公开，也不会把参考资料当作你的亲身经历。</p></div></header>\n          <form data-smart-search-form=\"\" class=\"dp-actions\"><label class=\"pm-field\">筛选状态<select data-smart-filter=\"\"><option value=\"pending\">待确认</option><option value=\"confirmed\">已确认</option><option value=\"rejected\">不采用</option><option value=\"all\">全部</option></select></label><label class=\"pm-field\">搜索笔记<input type=\"search\" data-smart-search=\"\" maxlength=\"100\" placeholder=\"输入标题或材料关键词\"></label><button class=\"pm-btn\" type=\"submit\">搜索</button></form>\n          <div class=\"dp-actions\"><label class=\"pm-field\">这些材料主要是<select data-smart-authorship=\"\"><option value=\"unknown\">暂不确定，不写成本人经历</option><option value=\"own\">我本人的真实经历</option><option value=\"reference\">学习、阅读或他人的案例</option><option value=\"opinion\">我认可的观点</option></select></label><label class=\"dp-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-smart-purpose=\"\" value=\"video\" checked=\"\">允许用于短视频</label><label class=\"dp-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-smart-purpose=\"\" value=\"moments\">允许用于朋友圈</label><button class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" type=\"button\" data-smart-confirm=\"\">确认选中的笔记，用于短视频</button><button class=\"pm-btn\" type=\"button\" data-smart-reject=\"\">不采用选中的笔记</button></div><p class=\"pm-muted\">保存确认会以本次勾选的用途为准；取消某个用途后，这类创作就不再使用它。原来只共享给短视频的笔记，不会自动开放给朋友圈。</p>\n          <p class=\"smart-selection-status\" data-smart-selection-status=\"\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><div data-smart-materials=\"\"><p class=\"pm-muted\">这里暂时没有符合条件的笔记。</p></div><nav class=\"sm-pagination\" data-smart-pages=\"\" aria-label=\"笔记翻页\"></nav>\n        <details class=\"smart-source-updates\"><summary>来源有更新：查看并决定是否接收</summary><p class=\"pm-muted\">来源更新后可先对照；接收会另存私密笔记，新版需要重新确认用途。</p><div data-smart-updates=\"\"><p class=\"pm-muted\">暂时没有待处理的来源更新。</p></div></details></section>\n        <details class=\"settings-card pm-panel smart-gifts\" id=\"smart-gifts\" data-creative-offers=\"\"><summary class=\"pm-heading\"><h2><span class=\"smart-section-number\">04</span>可提供的赠品</h2></summary><div class=\"smart-gifts-body\"><p class=\"pm-muted\">合适时会在稿件末尾建议邀请留言。商业定位可单独写一行“赠品：赠品名称”；发布前请确认赠品仍可提供、你能发给对方。</p><form data-offer-form=\"\"><label class=\"pm-field\">赠品名称<input name=\"name\" maxlength=\"100\" required=\"\"></label><label class=\"pm-field\">具体内容<input name=\"description\" maxlength=\"500\" required=\"\"></label><label class=\"pm-field\">适合谁<input name=\"audience\" maxlength=\"200\" required=\"\"></label><label class=\"pm-field\">领取地址<input name=\"deliveryUrl\" maxlength=\"1000\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"站内会员页面或 HTTPS 链接\"></label><label class=\"pm-field\">有效期至（可不填）<input name=\"expiresAt\" type=\"date\"></label><label class=\"dp-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"confirmed\" required=\"\">我确认赠品真实有效，领取方式可用</label><button class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" type=\"submit\">保存赠品</button></form><div data-offer-list=\"\"></div><p class=\"pm-status\" data-offer-status=\"\" role=\"status\"></p></div></details>\n        <section class=\"settings-card pm-panel\" id=\"smart-video\"><header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2><span class=\"smart-section-number\">05</span>准备短视频</h2><p data-smart-daily=\"\">尚未开启自动备稿，可进入今日准备查看权限和设置。</p></div></header><p class=\"pm-muted\">没有新材料时，可以继续使用以前已确认的笔记。提供时间、条数、账户与预算沿用今日自动备稿；这里不会另起一轮付费任务。</p><div class=\"dp-actions\"><a class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/daily-preparation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">查看今日准备与设置</a></div></section>\n        <section class=\"settings-card pm-panel\" id=\"moments\"><header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2><span class=\"smart-section-number\">06</span>准备朋友圈</h2><p data-sm-status=\"\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">每日朋友圈准备暂未开通，请先确认自动备稿与朋友圈编辑权限。</p></div></header>\n          <p class=\"pm-muted\">先准备少量不同角度的备选文字，挑中后再带到原朋友圈工作页修改。只使用你明确允许用于朋友圈的笔记；没有合适笔记时，可参考已保存的商业定位写观点，不编造经历。不会自动发布。</p>\n          <form data-sm-form=\"\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"dp-actions\"><label class=\"pm-field\">每天准备几条<select data-sm-count=\"\"><option value=\"1\">1条</option><option value=\"2\">2条</option><option value=\"3\" selected=\"\">3条</option><option value=\"4\">4条</option><option value=\"5\">5条</option><option value=\"6\">6条</option><option value=\"7\">7条</option></select></label><label class=\"pm-field\">朋友圈怎么写<select data-sm-mix=\"\"><option value=\"auto\">自动搭配不同类型</option><option value=\"life\">生活小事</option><option value=\"insight\">工作感悟</option><option value=\"professional\">专业经验</option></select></label><label class=\"pm-field\">当天几点提供<input type=\"time\" data-sm-time=\"\" min=\"06:00\" max=\"22:00\" value=\"08:00\" required=\"\"></label><label class=\"pm-field\">每日合计估算额度（元）<input type=\"number\" data-sm-budget=\"\" min=\"0.01\" step=\"0.01\" required=\"\"></label></div>\n          <label class=\"pm-field member-action-field\">最近想和朋友聊什么（可不填）<textarea data-sm-brief=\"\" maxlength=\"1000\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"例如：聊聊客户常问的问题，也穿插一点真实的工作感受\"></textarea></label>\n          <p data-sm-model=\"\"></p><p class=\"pm-muted\" data-sm-cost=\"\"></p><p class=\"pm-muted\">首次开启立即准备；以后每天凌晨01:00—05:00准备，到你选的时间提供。与短视频共用会员、共享账户和全站的每日费用上限。每条默认只写一轮；失败不自动重发，手动补齐可能再次收费。连续3天未登录会暂停，回来后需重新开启。</p>\n          <label class=\"dp-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-sm-consent=\"\" required=\"\">我同意使用上面显示的账户准备朋友圈，已了解费用、材料用途和暂停规则</label><div class=\"dp-actions\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\">确认并开启每日朋友圈准备</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-sm-pause=\"\">暂停每日朋友圈准备</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-sm-fill=\"\">补齐今天未完成的文字</button><a class=\"pm-btn\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html#settings-ai-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">查看模型账户</a></div></form>\n          <div class=\"dp-actions\" data-sm-browse=\"\" hidden=\"\"><label class=\"pm-field\">查看哪一天<select data-sm-week=\"\" aria-label=\"朋友圈准备日期\"></select></label><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-sm-refresh=\"\">刷新进度</button></div><div data-sm-items=\"\"></div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <dialog class=\"pm-dialog\" data-smart-dialog=\"\"><header class=\"pm-heading\"><h2>查看来源更新</h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"pm-btn\" data-smart-close=\"\">关闭</button></header><div data-smart-diff=\"\"></div><div class=\"dp-actions\"><button class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" type=\"button\" data-smart-accept=\"\">接收新版为私密笔记</button><button class=\"pm-btn\" type=\"button\" data-smart-keep=\"\">保留旧版，忽略这次更新</button></div></dialog>\n\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-restore\" data-sidebar-restore=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\" title=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button><div class=\"nav-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\"></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog\" data-global-search-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-search=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"global-search-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>GLOBAL SEARCH</span><h2 id=\"global-search-title\">全站搜索</h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-search=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭搜索\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <label class=\"global-search-field\">\n        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#spark\"></use></svg>\n        <input type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"搜索你感兴趣的任何内容吧\" aria-label=\"搜索关键词\">\n        <kbd>ESC</kbd>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"global-search-status\">输入关键词，快速找到可以继续使用的内容。</div>\n      <div class=\"global-search-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </section></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog daily-action-dialog\" data-daily-action-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-daily=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel daily-action-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"daily-action-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>DAILY CHECK-IN</span><h2 id=\"daily-action-title\">今日行动 <small class=\"daily-action-brand\">每日出摊</small></h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-daily=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭今日行动\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <p class=\"daily-action-hint\">辛苦一天不容易，赶紧记一笔，再小的成果也是进步。</p>\n      <form data-daily-action-form=\"\" class=\"daily-action-form\">\n        <fieldset>\n          <legend>行动类型 <em class=\"required\">必填</em></legend>\n          <div class=\"daily-action-options\">\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_moments\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了条朋友圈</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"xhs_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇小红书</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_channels_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了视频号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇公众号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_card\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发布了公众号贴图</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"short_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了短视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"long_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"